<title>UK: IBCA rates LW Rentenbank EMTN prog AAA.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates LW Rentenbank EMTN prog AAA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European rating agency said on Thursday it had assigned a long-term rating of AAA and a short-term rating of A1 plus to the senior and subordinated notes issued under Landwirtschaftliche Rentenbank's $10 billion EMTN programme.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of Landwirtschaftliche Rentenbank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
</text>
